HED version="2.0.0" library="testconflict" withStandard="8.5.0" unmerged="True"

'''Prologue'''
testconflict 2.0.0 partners with standard schema 8.5.0. Changes from 1.1.2: deletes Legacy-tag (major bump: tag deleted) and adds the Rooted-tag subtree rooted under the standard Event tag. Partnering an unpartnered library is itself a major change (testlib precedent).

!# start schema

'''Object-tag''' <nowiki>[An ordinary hierarchy of items used for annotations in schema load tests.]</nowiki>
* Object-one <nowiki>[The first object item.]</nowiki>
* Object-two <nowiki>[The second object item.]</nowiki>
* Object-three <nowiki>[The third object item.]</nowiki>

'''Measure-tag''' <nowiki>[A tag that takes a measurement value in load tests.]</nowiki>
* <nowiki># {takesValue}[Value of Measure-tag.]</nowiki>

'''Shared-item''' <nowiki>[An item identical in every library that shares it.]</nowiki>

'''Attribute-item''' <nowiki>{suggestedTag=Object-one}[An item whose suggestedTag value is the controlled difference between libraries.]</nowiki>

'''Description-item''' <nowiki>[An item whose description text is the controlled difference between libraries. This is the testconflict wording.]</nowiki>

'''Anchor-item''' <nowiki>[The testconflict parent of Nested-item.]</nowiki>
* Nested-item <nowiki>[An item whose position in the hierarchy is the controlled difference between libraries.]</nowiki>

'''Placeholder-item''' <nowiki>[An item whose placeholder child presence is the controlled difference between libraries.]</nowiki>
* <nowiki># {takesValue}[Value of Placeholder-item.]</nowiki>

'''Rooted-tag''' <nowiki>{rooted=Event}[The target subtree of the rooted and shared-hierarchy load cases.]</nowiki>
* Rooted-one <nowiki>[The first child of Rooted-tag, shared across libraries in the hierarchy cases.]</nowiki>
** Deep-one <nowiki>[The grandchild of Rooted-tag through Rooted-one.]</nowiki>
* Rooted-two <nowiki>[The second child of Rooted-tag, specific to testconflict.]</nowiki>

!# end schema

